  "body": "**tools: lint first Alpha release proposals**\n\n```\nThe release proposal linter assumed that a changelog without a\n`### Commits` section belongs to a semver-major release whose proposal\ncontains only the release commit. The first Alpha release of a line has\nthe same changelog layout, but its proposal may carry commits picked\ninto `vN.x-staging` after the branch-off, which made the linter fail\nwith \"Cannot find <sha> on the list\".\n\nLook the proposal commits up in the `Semver-*` lists instead, and skip\nthe check that every listed commit is in the proposal, since that list\ncovers every commit since the previous release line.\n```\n\nRefs: https://github.com/nodejs/node/pull/67062\n\nFailing run: https://github.com/nodejs/node/actions/runs/40565738078/job/122406379593\n\nChecked locally against the v27.0.0-alpha.0.0.0 proposal (passes with the two staging commits listed) and against v26.12.1 (unchanged behaviour, and a commit missing from the changelog is still rejected).\n",
